<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Edegel started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Edegel started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan analyst Jonathan Arnold started coverage of Peruvian power generator Edegel SA with a rating of long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are setting a 12-month target price for Edegel of $0.55 per share, which is eight percent above the current price ...,&quot; Arnold wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Although the near-term growth outlook is modest, our long-term buy rating is designed to capture the attractive longer-term growth potential once Edegel articulates a more structured expansion program.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed Monday at 1.35 soles in Lima.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
